  #
  # The bulk of this block is auto-generated by `ws sync-graph` from each
  # repo's flake.lock.  Nix's flake parser requires `inputs` to be a literal
  # attrset (no `let`, `//`, `import`, or `builtins.mapAttrs` allowed), so
